meta {
  name: Request upload
  type: http
  seq: 0
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/api/stock-imports/uploads
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "contentType": "application/pdf",
    "sizeBytes": 52000,
    "fileName": "nota.pdf"
  }
}

docs {
  Step 1: returns uploadId, uploadUrl, method PUT and the headers to send. sizeBytes must be the exact file size. Then run Storage / Upload file to presigned URL and Create import. 503 STOCK_IMPORT_UNAVAILABLE for images/PDF when AI is off (XML works).
}
